source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A backslash directly in front of a token the gate fires on is consumed, and the token's characters are what Jira shows.
-- input.jira --
x \:) y
-- rendered.html --
<p>x :) y</p>
-- want.md --
x :) y
-- warnings.json --
[]
